1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He is the eponymous ancestor of the Adnanite Arab Banu Kinanah tribe https://www.wikiwand.com/en/Banu_Kinanah which was a branch of the Quraysh tribe. Kinanah ibn Khuzayma was also the ancestor of the people of the
2 CONC  Quraysh , including the Islamic prophet Muhammad.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Geneaology:''' Kinanah ibn ("son of") Khuzaimah ibn Madrakah ibn Ilyas (''Elijah'') ibn Madher ibn Nazar ibn Ma'ad ibn Adnan ibn Add ibn Send ibn Napyot '''ibn Ishmael ibn Abraham''' ibn Azar  (''Terah'') ibn Nahoor ibn Srooj i
2 CONC bn Ra'o ibn Phaleg ibn Aber ibn Shaleh ibn Arpheckshad ibn Sam ibn Noah ibn Lamek ibn Motoshaleh ibn Edres (''Enoch'') ibn Yared ibn Mehlaiel ibn Qenan ibn Anosh ibn Sheeth ibn Adam.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Biblical Age 133'''
2 CONT
