1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Progenitor/ Found of Tribe of ''Banu Quraysh''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Fihr was called Quraysh and whose tribe was called after him.
2 CONT * Fihr was a personage of great influence & power, and the famous tribe/ clan of ''Banu Quraysh'' are his descendants.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source 1: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kilab_ibn_Murrah
2 CONT
2 CONT Source 2: http://community.fortunecity.ws/tattooine/spock/67/gen/saadid.htm
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT The father of Quraish family (Bani Quraish).
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT فهر
2 CONT
2 CONT Fihr is counted among the direct ancestors of Muhammad. In the lineage of Muhammad from Adnan, Fihr precedes Muhammad by eleven generations.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fihr defended Mecca against the Himyarite King of Yemen who wanted transfer Kaaba to Yemen.
2 CONT
2 CONT A sharp engagement followed in which Himyar were defeated, and their King Hassan was taken prisoner by Fihr for two years until he paid his ransom.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is the common ancestor of all the ten promised paradise as all of them belonged to the Quraysh tribe.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fihr_ibn_Malik
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Lineage of Zubayr ibn Awwam who descended from Asad ibn Abd al-Uzza. < [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asad_ibn_Abd_al-Uzza Wikipedia] >
