1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Wilaadat (Birth): 
2 CONT * Wafaat (Death): 9th ZilHajja 60 AH (12th September 680 AD)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes of Research  by Mulla Saadullah Husami.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sayyidna Muslim bin Aqeel is considered as the major Shaheed in the battle of Karbalaa ,having been attained Shahaadat in Kufa when he went there to ask the Kufis as to why and what for they had called Imaam e Husain in Kufa and I
2 CONC raq.He was greeted with negligence and makr o fareb and ultimately Yazeedi Qaum laid him as martyr at Kufa on 9th Zulhajja ,the day Imaame Husain left Makka e Muazzama for Kufa Iraq via Madeena e Munawwara.
2 CONT
2 CONT His Rauza is just besides  Masjid-e-Kufa in Iraq.
2 CONT
