2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT   (Redirected from Husain ibn Ali)
2 CONT
2 CONT Imam Husayn ibn Ali ibn Abi Talib (626 – 680). For the modern political figure (1852 – 1931), see Hussein bin Ali, Sharif of Mecca.
2 CONT
