2 DATE ABT 110
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Abdullah ibn Waqid ibn 'Abdullah ibn 'Umar ibn al-Khattab
2 CONT
2 CONT    His mother was Amatullah bint 'Abdullah.  His children were Waqid, Umm 'Uthman, Ruqayya, Sawda, and 'Atika, whose mother was Umm Jamil bint Abi Bakr.  He related from Ibn Umar and Yahya ibn Sa'id, and Usama ibn Zayd related fro
2 CONC m him.  
2 CONT
2 CONT    He died early on in 110 AH while Hisham was Khalif. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source Men of Madina Vol. II , Muhammad ibn Sa'd, page 291-292.
