2 CONT     Al-Fath ar-Rabbani (The Sublime Revelation)available for download (urdu)
2 CONT     Malfuzat (Utterances)
2 CONT     Futuh al-Ghaib (Revelations of the Unseen) available for download (urdu) (English)
2 CONT     Jala' al-Khatir (The Removal of Care)
2 CONT     Bahajja-Tul Asrar (Ground Secerets)
2 CONT
